{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-64","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"The square on the side of a rational plus a medial area applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the fifth binomial.","book":10,"number":64,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":64,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","contentId":"euclid-10-64","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00a9128d98a84e44639b18ee79c855b151eb6e22ecadf9d89682ab3026b1b5f1","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-64.statement","euclid-10-64.construction.1","euclid-10-64.construction.2","euclid-10-64.proof.1","euclid-10-64.proof.2","euclid-10-64.proof.3","euclid-10-64.proof.4","euclid-10-64.proof.5","euclid-10-64.proof.6","euclid-10-64.proof.7","euclid-10-64.conclusion","euclid-10-64.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-64.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd62e0b7d0d57f1025c7c4076b0cf8c30bfe8e1be5288a12ae8c7c96c3576a94","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on the side of a rational plus a medial area applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the fifth binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有理加中项无理线段区域边上的正方形 用于有理线段生产 宽度为5 二项无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85086c2dd24693c17477a9cd7f515e212b6e7ef60607ef6d7dfdfa087cb952fd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the side of a rational plus a medial area, divided into its straight lines at C, so that AC is the greater; let a rational straight line DE be set out, and let there be applied to DE the parallelogram DF equal to the square on AB, producing DG as its breadth; I say that DG is a fifth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为有理加上中项无理线段个区域的一面,分为C直线,数量更大,AC;让有理线段 DE加入,AB加入平行四边形 DF,相当于AB加入正方形,宽度扩大为DG;我说,DG加入第5条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fbd20b1e08d70280cc7d427f0a58019d906730f18f29def00add16bac3c88a9e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the same construction as before be made."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"做以前一样的工程"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c273e606e6105d53162da6636c3754c95db97b0799a1617f6da9e364e5562dd5","citations":["euclid-10-40"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then AB is the side of a rational plus a medial area, divided at C, therefore AC, CB are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial, but the rectangle contained by them rational. [[X. 40](/principles/euclid-10-40)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,AB区域为有理个加上中项无理线段个区域,面积分为C,因此,正方形的不可公度直线为AC,正方形的正方形个直线为正方形个直线,有理个直线为矩形个直线。（相关点与线段：CB） [[X. 40](/principles/euclid-10-40)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fad9f8d21c767a9753614bdc27dd26438f86010fbfff6b90a8d703cc6b37f28f","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the sum of the squares on AC, CB is medial, therefore DL is medial, so that DM is rational and incommensurable in length with DE. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为 AC 与 CB 的平方和为中项无理量，所以 DL 也是中项无理量；因此 DM 是有理量，并且与 DE 在长度上不可公度。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"70cbfe0efd3df84ae45996242c672a17c3419a0b28cd9f0439bc17bdd6870eec","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since twice the rectangle AC, CB, that is MF, is rational, therefore MG is rational and commensurable with DE. [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,矩形 AC,CB,即MF的两倍,即有理,MG,有理,可公度,DE。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"011bf9b7552dd11c491e0ad47aa00e2d4a68cc43451f4cc628734291e530591a","citations":["euclid-10-13","euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DM is incommensurable with MG; [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] therefore DM, MG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore DG is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DM是不可公度,MG;DM,MG是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;DG是二项无理线段。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"63c7eb729f299f1e0929a9843a59bd56df19fa76f19e4e43a41e72e4dd11c7b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a fifth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第五条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87ed16bf522700aa0c5bf20bad3a80c75e348bb4960677fcbbf675d4fbfae4a6","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For it can be proved similarly that the rectangle DK, KM is equal to the square on MN, and that DK is incommensurable in length with KM; therefore the square on DM is greater than the square on MG by the square on a straight line incommensurable with DM. [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,矩形 DK,KM等于MN,DK长为KM;因此,DM长为不可公度,比MG直线不可公度和DM直线正方形大。 [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7cbded48fc595879c77d2fa64ee02d47c2ed7fa38878425a43d72bcede70aab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And DM, MG are commensurable in square only, and the less, MG, is commensurable in length with DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DM,MG是平方可公度而长度不可公度, 数量较少的,MG,长度可公度,DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b52201db85d81ef1a17958012af73f38b132c984f9f168354d9e217583ffe9e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DG is a fifth binomial. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DG是第5个二项无理线段 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-64.source","contentId":"euclid-10-64","revisionId":"euclid-10-64@raw-00a9128d98a84e44","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acae138b49cf91b27779785d6ecf36442024a0794478c6923427952b0158bb14","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-64:euclid-10-40:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-64","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-64.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-40","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64/","sourceLabel":"X. 40"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-64:euclid-10-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-64","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-64.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64/","sourceLabel":"X. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-64:euclid-10-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-64","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-64.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64/","sourceLabel":"X. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-64:euclid-10-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-64","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-64.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.64/","sourceLabel":"X. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-64:euclid-10-36:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-64","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-64.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-36","type"